        <div class="steps-container">
            <div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Step 1</span><h3 class="step-title">Obtain IEC from DGFT Delhi (Pre-requisite)</h3><p class="step-description">IEC from DGFT is mandatory before any bank issues AD Code. Apply online at dgft.gov.in. DGFT Delhi Regional Office at Udyog Bhawan, Maulana Azad Road issues IEC in 1-3 working days. Patron starts bank letter drafting concurrently while IEC processes - eliminating serial delay.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>IEC Obtained</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Concurrent Workflow Started</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="20" y="15" width="80" height="55" rx="6" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.5"/><text x="60" y="35" font-size="8" fill="#14365F" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">DGFT</text><text x="60" y="52" font-size="7" fill="#E8712C" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">IEC</text></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">IEC Ready</span><span class="step-number-large">01</span></div></div></div>

<div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Step 2</span><h3 class="step-title">Obtain AD Code Letter from Your Bank</h3><p class="step-description">Write formal letter to Branch Manager of your RBI-authorized AD bank requesting AD Code. Must reference IEC and specify Delhi port (INDEL4 or INTKD6). Bank issues 14-digit AD Code on letterhead in 1-3 days. Name and address must exactly match IEC certificate.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>AD Code Letter Received</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Port-Specific Format</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="15" y="10" width="90" height="65" rx="6" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.5"/><text x="60" y="30" font-size="7" fill="#14365F" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">BANK</text><line x1="30" y1="38" x2="90" y2="38" stroke="#F5A623" stroke-width="3"/><text x="60" y="55" font-size="8" fill="#E8712C" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">AD CODE</text></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">Bank Letter Ready</span><span class="step-number-large">02</span></div></div></div>

<div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Step 3</span><h3 class="step-title">Register on ICEGATE 2.0 and Upload Documents</h3><p class="step-description">Create ICEGATE account at icegate.gov.in as IEC holder. Class 3 DSC required. Upload all documents via eSanchit: AD Code letter, IEC, PAN, GST, cancelled cheque, authorization letter. Each gets a DRN and IRN. Ensure exact name/address match across all documents.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>ICEGATE Registered</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Documents Uploaded</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="15" y="5" width="90" height="70" rx="6" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.5"/><text x="60" y="25" font-size="8" fill="#14365F" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">ICEGATE</text><line x1="30" y1="35" x2="90" y2="35" stroke="#F5A623" stroke-width="3"/><rect x="30" y="45" width="55" height="14" rx="3" fill="#E8712C" opacity="0.15"/><text x="58" y="55" font-size="6" fill="#E8712C" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">eSANCHIT</text></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">eSanchit Complete</span><span class="step-number-large">03</span></div></div></div>

<div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Step 4</span><h3 class="step-title">Register AD Code at Delhi Customs Port on ICEGATE</h3><p class="step-description">Navigate to Financial Services > Bank Account Management > AD Code Registration. Select Delhi port: INDEL4 (IGI Airport) or INTKD6 (Tughlakabad). Enter AD Code and IRN, complete OTP. SEPARATELY register IFSC port-wise for Duty Drawback and IGST refunds - the step most exporters miss.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>AD Code Registered</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>IFSC Port-wise Done</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="15" y="10" width="35" height="55" rx="4" fill="#FFF3E0" stroke="#F5A623" stroke-width="1"/><text x="33" y="42" font-size="5" fill="#E8712C" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">INDEL4</text><rect x="55" y="10" width="35" height="55" rx="4" fill="#E8F5E9" stroke="#10B981" stroke-width="1"/><text x="73" y="42" font-size="5" fill="#10B981" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">INTKD6</text></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">Port Linked</span><span class="step-number-large">04</span></div></div></div>

<div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Step 5</span><h3 class="step-title">Track Status, Download Certificate, Begin Exporting</h3><p class="step-description">Track on ICEGATE dashboard. Customs approval in 3-4 working days. Download AD Code Registration Certificate. Share with CHA and freight forwarder. First shipping bill can now be generated on ICEGATE. RoDTEP and Duty Drawback credits flow to IFSC-registered bank account.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Certificate Downloaded</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>First Shipping Bill Ready</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="20" y="10" width="80" height="65" rx="6" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="60" cy="42" r="20" fill="#E8F5E9" stroke="#10B981" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M50 42l7 7 14-14" stroke="#10B981" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/><text x="60" y="85" font-size="7" fill="#14365F" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">EXPORT</text></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">Export Ready</span><span class="step-number-large">05</span></div></div></div>

