            <div class="highlight-box" style="margin-top:32px;">
                <p><strong>Quick Answers</strong></p>
                <p><strong>Delhi mein AD Code registration kaise karein?</strong> Pehle DGFT se IEC lo. Phir bank se AD Code letter lo (1-3 din). ICEGATE 2.0 par documents upload karo, Bank Account Management mein AD Code register karo - INDEL4 (IGI Airport) ya INTKD6 (Tughlakabad) select karo. Class 3 DSC mandatory hai. Approval 3-4 working days.</p><p><strong>Is AD Code same as IEC?</strong> No. IEC = 10-digit DGFT identity. AD Code = 14-digit bank code linking IEC to bank account at customs port. Both mandatory - IEC first, then AD Code.</p><p><strong>AD Code ki validity?</strong> Lifetime - no renewal required. But if bank changes, update AD Code on ICEGATE with new bank details.</p>

